# Only the private key needs to stay out of git — the public key it derives
# (extension-key-pub.b64) is safe to commit: it's embedded verbatim in the
# published manifest.json anyway, and CI needs it to build the same
# extension ID as local builds.
.secrets/extension-key.pem
.secrets/extension-key-pub.der
